    "自动": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "转写": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认为中文。自动识别会让模型在中文、粤语、英语、日语和韩语之间判断。仅影响之后开始的新录音与新导入；已完成文稿不会自动重跑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default is Chinese. Chinese & English lets the model choose between Chinese and English; you can also pin Cantonese, English, Japanese, or Korean. Applies only to new recordings and imports — finished transcripts are not rerun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认为中文。中英双语会让模型在中文和英语之间自动判断；也可指定粤语、英语、日语或韩语。仅影响之后开始的新录音与新导入；已完成文稿不会自动重跑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default is Chinese. Chinese & English auto-detects between Chinese and English; you can also pin Cantonese, English, Japanese, or Korean. Applies only to new recordings and imports — finished transcripts are not rerun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录音时实时转写": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribe while recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，每段录音一结束就开始转写。关闭后，等你停止录音再排队，录音过程更省电、也少抢性能。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, each finished segment starts transcribing immediately. When off, work waits until you stop, which uses less power during capture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许转写在后台继续": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow transcription in the background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在你停止录音、导入或手动重试后申请。语音仍在本机处理；系统可因电量、发热或你的取消操作中止，之后回到应用会继续。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requested after you stop, import, or retry. Speech stays on-device. iOS may pause for battery, heat, or cancellation; returning to the app continues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 26 以上可允许长转写在后台继续；当前系统会在回到应用后自动续跑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 26 and later can keep long transcriptions running in the background. On this system, work continues when you return to the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
