            "value": "Only confirmed profiles sync, and they are encrypted first. Unconfirmed voiceprints are not synced."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "公开文档与加密声纹同步相互独立。iCloud 不可用时，加密档案只保留在本机，不阻塞录音与转写。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Document sync and encrypted voiceprint sync are independent. If iCloud is unavailable, archives stay on-device and never block recording."
